room marrow_quarterdeck "The Marrow — Quarterdeck"
  bg bg_quarterdeck_wide
  width 2560
  music music_sea
  ambience sea
  perspective horizon 250 ref 875 height 320
  walk (100,875) (150,690) (2380,700) (2500,875)
  entry 300,800
  arrive marrow_deck 1700,790
  arrive marrow_cabin 690,728

  # Atmosphere: the stern lanterns, sun on the wake, timbers creaking.
  footsteps deck
  light 175,515 radius 130 lantern
  light 1382,432 radius 90 lantern
  light 2060,450 radius 140 lantern
  motes glints (1640,262) (2160,262) (2160,365) (1600,380) count 24
  emit creak

  # Quill, navigator, taking her sights by the binnacle.
  sprite npc_quill_body at 1300,720 size 0.98 flip idle speaker quill for quill grade "saturate(0.85) brightness(0.92)"
  # Vane comes up to the wheel once she has decided.
  sprite npc_vane_body at 560,720 size 1 idle speaker vane for vane grade "saturate(0.85) brightness(0.9)"

  hotspot seas "the Straits"
    area 1400,180 900x280
    nowalk
    look "The Straits, ahead and to starboard, grey where the weather sits. Six ships went in in three years. Five came out empty. One didn't."
    use "I hold the compass up. The needle settles, patient as a dog at a door."

  hotspot wheel "the wheel"
    area 600,50 320x360
    stand 800,790
    look "The wheel, lashed to the captain's heading. It's bigger than it looks from the quay, like most things that matter."
    use "I put a hand on it. The ship doesn't notice, but I do."
    turnon "There's nothing to turn on. The ship is already doing it."

  hotspot binnacle "the binnacle"
    area 980,170 200x330
    stand 1080,790
    look "The binnacle. A ship's compass in brass and glass, swinging slow. I take out my father's and hold them side by side. They disagree."
    use "The ship's compass points north. Mine points at the Straits. One of them is wrong, and the ship's compass has never lost a ship."
    open "Sealed. You don't open a binnacle any more than you open a doctor."

  hotspot cabin_door "door to the cabin"
    area 410,288 180x180
    stand 690,728
    exit marrow_cabin
    look "Carved doors under the wheel deck: the captain's cabin, and the charts."
    open "I knock, and go in. A licence entitles me to knock."

  hotspot stairs_down "steps to the deck"
    area 40,520 220x300
    stand 300,810
    exit marrow_deck sound stairs
    look "The steps back down to the main deck."

  hotspot quill "Quill"
    show if quill_navigator
    area 1210,420 180x280
    stand 1450,780
    look "Quill, navigator, Pell's sextant on a cord round her neck. She keeps touching it to make sure it's there, and pretending she isn't."
    talk "She heard me three steps ago. She finishes her sum first, so I know where I rank."
      talk quill at nav
    give "“If it isn't a star or a bearing, cargo, I don't need it.”"

  hotspot vane "Captain Vane"
    show if vane_convinced
    area 470,400 190x300
    stand 760,780
    look "Captain Vane at the head of her quarterdeck, hat on, watching the fog come to meet us."
    talk "“Why are you still aft, clerk? The bow. The fog won't wait, and neither will the reef.”"
    give "“The only thing I want from you now is bearings.”"
  use compass on binnacle
    "I hold my father's compass beside the ship's. North, says one. The Straits, says the other. They glare at each other."
  use compass on seas
    "The needle points into the grey off the bow. The Straits are where it wants to go. It has never wanted anything so much."
  use spyglass on seas
    "Grey, then more grey, then a gull, very large and very cross about it."
